{
  "id": "401901",
  "resourceId": 19,
  "name": "瑪麗安：女王",
  "skin": "最後的愛戀",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c019_01_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c019_01_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "這一次，我一定會守護大家。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "不覺得這件婚紗美到不行嗎？\n穿上婚紗是我一直以來的夢想。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "您很擔心吧？\n現在已經沒事了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，我們什麼時候要去郊遊呢？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "現在總算知道\n我真正想做的是什麼了。\n所以，我一定能贏。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官，您怎麼總是如此溫柔？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "能與指揮官再度相遇，\n我真的很高興。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "我會永遠守護著您。\n我愛您，指揮官。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "我會讓大家都能生活在充滿愛的世界裡。\n我一定會親手實現。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "我全心全意地愛您，指揮官。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "我喜歡指揮官的笑容。\n所以……今後也請一直這樣笑著。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官是我愛的第一人，也是最後一人。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "您會回來的吧？\n我知道的，指揮官。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "這是要讓新娘空等嗎？好過分。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "慢慢來也沒關係。\n我會在這裡，\n守護著大家歸來的地方。",
      "animation": "shy_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "有這麼帥的新郎在這裡，我還能跑去哪。\n所以儘管放心，去忙您的吧。",
      "animation": "shy_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "每次來到這裡，\n都有種回到家的感覺。\n很溫暖。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "現在只剩幸福的日子在等我們了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "有個能夠回來的地方，\n是一件很幸福的事。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "過來站在我旁邊。\n一起走吧。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "大家應該都過得不錯吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "等～燈燈燈～♪等～燈燈燈～♪",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "等很久了吧？\n今後我會站在指揮官的身邊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "人家說，結婚就是約定陪伴彼此到最後。\n您願意和我許下這個承諾嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "我的影響力變得更強大了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "又累積了經驗呢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "這下我能守護更多的東西了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "這樣一來，我就能把指揮官保護得更周全了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝您。\n我會將這份力量視為您託付給我的心意。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "……無論發生什麼事，我一定會保護您的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "不知道這樣的禮物還能收到多久呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀，您怎麼又準備了這種禮物呢。謝謝您。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "只要是指揮官給的，我什麼都喜歡。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "您現在是要用這個跟我求婚嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "蘊含心意的禮物總是這麼溫暖。\n……無論身在何處，我都不會忘記這份心意。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "對我來說，和您在一起的每分每秒都像禮物。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "不管什麼時候看到指揮官，都覺得好開心。",
      "animation": "shy_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "指揮官什麼時候看都好帥。",
      "animation": "shy_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "我喜歡您，指揮官。\n我是真心喜歡您的。",
      "animation": "shy_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "我又再次愛上您了，請您負起責任。",
      "animation": "shy_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "最想回來的地方、最想守護到最後的地方……\n就是指揮官身邊。",
      "animation": "shy_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "我對指揮官的心意絕不改變。",
      "animation": "shy_02"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "我會好好帶領大家。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "新娘可以進場了嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "我在聽。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "是，指揮官，我在這裡。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "往這邊走就可以了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "並肩同行吧，指揮官。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "開始了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "要不要一起進場？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "我絕不會輸。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "只要和指揮官在一起，我什麼也不怕。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "現在已經不能退縮了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "您一定要緊緊跟在我身邊喔。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "……請您諒解。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "敬請期待我的表現。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "準備應對下一波攻擊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "我怎麼樣？漂亮嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "沒事的，別擔心。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "您完全移不開視線呢，指揮官。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "請躲到我後面。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "很快就好了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "有需要就儘管說。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "總算輪到我了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "為了充滿愛且不會有人受到傷害的世界。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "世界上最幸福的新娘，進場。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "我來開路！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "一起傾注全力吧！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "我會保護您的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "我會保護您的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "下一個呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "清除完畢！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "……我會盡量減少痛楚。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "全被我打倒了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "呃！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "啊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "啊！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "呃呃！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "啊嗚……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "哼！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
      "text": "呃呃……這次還是沒守住……\n對不起，指揮官。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_82",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_82.mp3",
      "text": "請再等我一下……我們很快就能再次相見的。一定。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_83",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_83.mp3",
      "text": "我一定會親手實現\n那個大家夢寐以求的世界。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_84",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_84.mp3",
      "text": "請牽著我的手吧，指揮官。\n今後，我們也一起攜手走下去。",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}